    "All *_hex values are lowercase hex. distro.private_key_hex is the X25519 private key (32) | Ed25519 seed (32), so D can be rebuilt; lxmf_delivery_hash_hex is D_hash = Destination.hash(D, 'lxmf', 'delivery').",
